@welfare
title: Support the Arbeiterwohlfahrt
subtitle: -1 resources
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if resources <= 0 : Not enough resources. ?]
choose-if: resources > 0 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if recession_seen; advisor_action_timer = 6

We fund counselling on debt, rent and benefits in the neighbourhoods that need it most.

@organizing_women
title: Campaign among women
subtitle: Reach out to women voters.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: womens_rights += 1; workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 2*(1-dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6

We campaign on care, equal pay and safety, and our women candidates lead the campaign.

